{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Anchor 可把 iPhone 變成返回指定地點的離線指南針，適合自駕、露營、遠足或常在訊號欠佳地方活動的人士。用戶只需在起點放下錨點，離開後便可依即時方向、距離與方位角找回停車位置、集合點、營地或自訂座標。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-21.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>無網絡仍可定位返回</h2>\n<p>Anchor 利用 iPhone 的衛星定位、指南針與動作感應器，無需地圖圖磚、流動數據、Wi-Fi 或下載離線區域，也能顯示即時方向、距離、方位角與海拔。訊號受阻時，步數估算會以步行與指南針推算，並清楚標示誤差擴大。它提供直線方位而非逐段步行路線，使用時仍須依安全路徑、標誌及現場情況判斷。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-16-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-17-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-18-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-19-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-20-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Anchor: Find Your Way Back</li><li>應用類別：Navigation</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/anchor-find-your-way-back/id6809837167?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:43.827894+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":347,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T19:37:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T05:18:28.113239+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:46.491616+00:00","content_hash":"c023dc926ca42125dad1951c8b532e6ff035aa18496fbeed3877c587adf2b6cc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}